:: Mom Kiss [interaction] {"position":"850,2400","size":"100,100"}
/* Intimate scene, reached from the "Kiss her" card of the NPC Interaction screen.
   The card's requirements and its once-per-day limit live in define_interactions.twee.
   Short placeholder: expand it however you like, the stat changes below are what the card promises. */
<<DisplayActivity $mom 500>>
The house is quiet. $mom.callName doesn't say anything when I step closer, and she doesn't step back either. For a moment we just look at each other, and I'm fairly sure she knows what's coming.

<<silently>>
<<set _msgs = [
  { who: $mom,    text: "$player.name, honey, we really shouldn't keep... is that a new shirt?" },
  { who: $player, text: "I've had it for two years." },
  { text: "She laughs, too high, and doesn't step back. I lean in, and she meets me halfway. The kiss is brief and careful, and when it ends, neither of us moves away." },
  { who: $mom,    text: "We're not going to make a big thing out of this, okay? It was a silly little moment, that's all it was." },
  { who: $player, text: "Sure. A silly little moment." }
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>

She smooths her hair, avoids my eyes, and goes back to what she was doing, but her hand is still unsteady, and she's smiling when she thinks I'm not looking.

<<UpdateStat "+" "MomLust" 5>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomCorruption" 3>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 2>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomResistance" 2>>

